<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM April-Dec 1996 RTKs rise 3 percent.</title>
<headline>KLM April-Dec 1996 RTKs rise 3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>KLM Royal Dutch Airline NV's</p>
<p>cargo traffic for the nine months ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    April-Dec				 1996     1995    %change</p>
<p>    Traffic(in millions of RTKs)	2,968    2,876   3</p>
<p>    Capacity(in millions of ATKs)     4,491    4,280   5</p>
<p>    Cargo load factor			66.1     67.2</p>
<p>    Yield(in NLG cents per RTK)	  43.7     43.8</p>
<p>    Unit revenue(in NLG cents per ATK) 28.9     29.4   (2)</p>
<p>--Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 8982 Fax + 5017</p>
</text>
